Subject: [PATCH 02/10] feat(gateway): harden node override policy, add MCP
 HTTP bridge, and security opt-in toggles

- Add MCP HTTP bridge for gateway server
- Harden node command policy and audit checks
- Add opt-in toggles to bypass skill symlink and workspace read restrictions
- Session archive improvements

